{"5047990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fish Go Brrr!", "steam_appid": 5047990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Go BRRR! is an <strong><i>incremental tycoon game</i></strong> with a hardcore survival twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/a2cc10499e6b846323119989765a9d07.poster.avif?t=1787789741\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/a2cc10499e6b846323119989765a9d07.webm?t=1787789741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/a2cc10499e6b846323119989765a9d07.mp4?t=1787789741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Feed your fish to earn coins, keep them fed or watch them starve, and decide whether to protect your colony or let your fish turn on each other... <i><strong>how will you keep your tank?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/0e262d8a410ca2296b85d7071beed865.poster.avif?t=1787789741\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/0e262d8a410ca2296b85d7071beed865.webm?t=1787789741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/0e262d8a410ca2296b85d7071beed865.mp4?t=1787789741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when things are calm, <i><strong>alien invaders show up to eat your fish</strong></i>. Fight back before your whole tank is wiped out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/82152fc949f88e8f7fa5388c09f7d7ee.poster.avif?t=1787789741\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/82152fc949f88e8f7fa5388c09f7d7ee.webm?t=1787789741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/82152fc949f88e8f7fa5388c09f7d7ee.mp4?t=1787789741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>EVERY level unlocks a unique special fish</strong></i> with rule-bending abilities to help you on your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual Pet Tank Mode: a calm, screensaver-style way to enjoy your tank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of hours worth of levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zone introduces a unique mechanic to keep the gameplay fresh.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Go BRRR! is an <strong><i>incremental tycoon game</i></strong> with a hardcore survival twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/a2cc10499e6b846323119989765a9d07.poster.avif?t=1787789741\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5047990/extras/a2cc10499e6b846323119989765a9d07.webm?t=17